          </span>
          <span data-tooltip-type="rich">
              <span class="glue-tooltip__body">As AI redefines identity verification in high stakes systems, it introduces novel risks like deepfake fraud and algorithmic bias, creating a critical trust deficit. This session will provide a practical framework for ethical governance, equipping leaders to build and manage secure, fair, and fundamentally trustworthy AI systems by design.</span>
              















