          <a class="row-card__heading glue-link" href=https://research.google/pubs/a-theoretical-framework-for-statistical-evaluability-of-generative-models/ >
            
              A Theoretical Framework for Statistical Evaluability of Generative Models
            
          </a>
        
        <div class="row-card__subheading">
          
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__item small-text">
                      
                        Shashaank Aiyer
                      
                    </div>
                
              
            
              
                
                  
                    <div class="row-card__subheading__spacer"></div>
